3, "story_id": 50361417, "title": "Building the NBC News Big Board", "updated_at": "2026-11-07T18:58:46Z", "url": "https://ejfox.com/projects/nbc-big-board"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "nateb2022"}, "title": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "Text.js: Build full-stack React apps that render inside console.log"}, "url": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "https://textjs.org/"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_nateb2022", "story_50361657", "front_page"], "author": "nateb2022", "children": [50405918, 50405954, 50406015, 50406136, 50406150, 50406255, 50406545, 50406572, 50406859], "created_at": "2026-11-04T04:59:36Z", "created_at_i": 1793768376, "num_comments": 20, "objectID": "50361657", "points": 49, "story_id": 50361657, "title": "Text.js: Build full-stack React apps that render inside console.log", "updated_at": "2026-11-07T18:59:16Z", "url": "https://textjs.org/"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "zaiev"}, "story_text": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "Spindle is a multicore-by-design, eio-native web framework for modern OCaml.<p>Its central idea is to provide an expressive, type-driven API and derive the rest: codecs, request validation, OpenAPI spec and frontend schemas (Zod and Melange). This keeps contracts in sync between server and client without maintaining separate definitions.<p>The framework includes an RFC-strict HTTP server, composable dependencies, WebSockets, SSE and high-level primitives for building MCP servers. It also provides production-ready essentials like distributed tracing, OT-compatible metrics, logging and other features you would expect. Speed was never the goal but the benchmarks show it running x2 faster than NestJS and x5 faster than FastAPI on a single core.<p>Give it a try.<p>Documentation: <a href=\"https://hyphatech.github.io/spindle/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hyphatech.github.io/spindle/</a>"}, "title": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "Show HN: Spindle – a full-featured, type-safe web framework for OCaml 5"}, "url": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "https://github.com/hyphatech/spindle"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_zaiev", "story_50377613", "show_hn", "front_page"], "author": "zaiev", "children": [50404701, 50405173, 50405538, 50405702], "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:45:28Z", "created_at_i": 1793875528, "num_comments": 8, "objectID": "50377613", "points": 49, "story_id": 50377613, "story_text": "Spindle is a multicore-by-design, eio-native web framework for modern OCaml.<p>Its central idea is to provide an expressive, type-driven API and derive the rest: codecs, request validation, OpenAPI spec and frontend schemas (Zod and Melange). This keeps contracts in sync between server and client without maintaining separate definitions.<p>The framework includes an RFC-strict HTTP server, composable dependencies, WebSockets, SSE and high-level primitives for building MCP servers. It also provides production-ready essentials like distributed tracing, OT-compatible metrics, logging and other features you would expect. Speed was never the goal but the benchmarks show it running x2 faster than NestJS and x5 faster than FastAPI on a single core.<p>Give it a try.<p>Documentation: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;hyphatech.github.io&#x2F;spindle&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;hyphatech.github.io&#x2F;spindle&#x2F;</a>", "title": "Show HN: Spindle – a full-featured, type-safe web framework for OCaml 5", "updated_at": "2026-11-07T18:56:17Z", "url": "https://github.com/hyphatech/spindle"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "robtherobber"}, "title": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "British Library Legal deposit and web archiving"}, "url": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "https://www.bl.uk/services/legal-deposit/web-arc